Third-party components
----------------------
Gextto depends on third-party libraries under their own licences. Two are worth
calling out explicitly:

- libtorrent (BSD-3-Clause): the default embedded BitTorrent engine, linked
  through CGo (libtorrent_bridge.cpp + libtorrent_bridge.h).
- github.com/anacrolix/torrent (Mozilla Public License 2.0): the optional native
  Go torrent backend. It is only compiled when the daemon is built with the
  `anacrolix` build tag (see `make build-anacrolix`).
  The default build does not include it.

The full licence texts of the vendored/module dependencies are available from
the Go module cache and the upstream projects.
